Crew Evaluation System test online for seamans about Deck department, Operational level, Oil Tanker.
This application will help you prepare and pass the CES test on the topic “Deck Operational Oil Tanker”. Such practice will help you as a marine professional to improve your knowledge through online learning and assessment practice. CES based on practical information and experience of maritime specialists.
- Crowd and Crisis Management; 
- Integrated Navigation System (INS); 
- Ballast water management; 
- Handling and Stowage; 
- Vessel operation management and safety; 
- Marine engineering; 
- Maintenance and repair, etc.

Application features:
• “Preparation” mode
• Exam mode
• “Marathon” mode
• Search questions

       Advantages:
• The application does not require an Internet connection;
• Tests are always “Available”.
• Many modes of working with tests.
